    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3189" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκίχητος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be reached, unattainable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκίχητα διώκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.75
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					4.52
				</span></i>
			; <i>not to be overtaken, swift</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκίχητος ἀΐσσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					45.236
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				333
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not to be reached by prayer, inexorable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤθεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					186
				</span></i>
			.</div>
